    "description": "Iran's Ministry of Economic Affairs and Finance has responsibilities spanning financial administration and investment-related institutions. Its affiliated Organization for Investment, Economic and Technical Assistance of Iran provides a documented example of how specialized bodies carry out functions within the portfolio. [s1][s2]",
